  "question": {
    "text": "Let $\\mathrm{A}=\\left(\\begin{array}{ccc}12 & 24 & 5 \\\\ \\mathrm{x} & 6 & 2 \\\\ -1 & -2 & 3\\end{array}\\right) .$ The value of $\\mathrm{x}$ for which the matrix $\\mathrm{A}$ is not invertible is",
